  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "56bBfYPBzpsuICMdJ13DBI2PsAE=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:31:50.265Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Merkle appears in the Flowable Partner Finder with 16,000 staff, a Columbia, Maryland base outside the EU, and the descriptor \"agency group\". Its row name carries its ownership: it sits inside dentsu.\n\nThe agency descriptor is part of the exclusion rather than colour. An agency group buys and builds around marketing and customer-experience outcomes, which is a different purchasing motion from a systems integrator selling delivery capacity against a client's back-office processes. Combined with the scale and the location, that leaves no version of this brief's motion that reaches it.\n\nNothing further was gathered, and nothing needed to be: the row was mined from the vendor's partner page on 2026-08-18 without an imprint sweep, and the exclusion applies on the card's face.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- Merkle (dentsu) (US Columbia MD) \u2014 merkle.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> 16,000 staff, agency group. Non-EU \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:31:50.265875Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:31:50.265880Z"
    }
  },
